/* Debit card / remote payment set up:
You no longer have to trek to places just to pay people for periodical stuff
This include: 
    * Pay off bank debt,
    * Bailey rent,
        yes I'm moving it from the office to here
        suffer
    *  House payment for lakehouse,
    * The guard guy in farm,
    * (I wanna set up a watering guy for fields too; 
        imagine a dude getting himself admitted to the asylum 
        just to water your flowers for you; 
        that's dedication), 
        that settles it I'm gonna make a flower shop later
    * Maybe anonymous financial support for Robin 
        in case you don't want to take up the debt?
        why the heck would you even need this  WELL I DON'T KNOW
        I'M JUST THROWING STUFF
    
That's the priority list; meaning it will start paying in that order.
More level just means you can deposit more and pay more at once

You get no other benefits from this. 
Yeah this is basically useless even on a good day. 
I really don't know how to make/use cash.
Send help.
*/
<<widget "hsbcBankOptions">>
    <<checkCreditStatus()>>
    <<if $hbsc.account.know is undefined>>
        <<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask about the bank (0:02)|HBSC Bank Ask Intro]]>><<set $hbsc.account.know to 1>><<pass 2>><</link>>
    <<else>>
        <<if $passage isnot "HBSC Bank Account">>
            <<if $hbsc.account.level lte 0>>
                <<link [[Open an account (0:02)|HBSC Bank Account]]>><<pass 2>><<set $hbsc.passage to "account">><</link>>
                <br>
            <<else>>
                <<if $hbsc.account.level gte 1 and $hbsc.account.level lt 5>>
                    <<link [[Upgrade your account (0:02)|HBSC Bank Account]]>><<pass 2>><<set $hbsc.passage to "account">><</link>>
                    <br>
                <</if>>
            <</if>>
        <</if>>
        <<if $passage isnot "HBSC Bank Ask Savings Accounts">>
            <<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask about savings accounts (0:02)|HBSC Bank Ask Savings Accounts]]>><<set $hbsc.savings.know to 1>><<pass 2>><</link>>
            <br>
        <</if>>
        <<if $passage isnot "HBSC Bank Ask Automatic Payment">>
            <<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask about automatic payment (0:02)|HBSC Bank Ask Automatic Payment]]>><<set $hbsc.payment.know to 1>><<pass 2>><</link>>
            <br>
        <</if>>
        <<if $passage isnot "HBSC Bank Ask Loan">>
            <<socialiseicon "ask">><<link [[Ask about loan (0:02)|HBSC Bank Ask Loan]]>><<set $hbsc.loan.know to 1>><<pass 2>><</link>>
            <br>
        <</if>>
    <</if>>
    <<if $hbsc.passage isnot "saving" and $hbsc.savings.know isnot undefined>>
        <<>>
    <</if>>
    <<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|High Street]]>><<set $hbsc.passage to undefined>><<endevent>><</link>>
    <br>
<</widget>>